    {
      "block_id": "2605.00224_p15_b10",
      "text": "Canonical DPO uses a fixed SFT reference or an SFT-fitted\nproxy. Because TUR-DPO often employs an EMA-updated\nreference as a soft trust region, we include a head-to-head\ncomparison with a strictly frozen reference. Across tasks\n(GSM8K, Open QA, BBH, TLDR, HH), EMA updating\nprovides modest but consistent improvements in stability\nand calibration, while win-rate differences remain small.\nWe therefore recommend EMA updating when available,\n",
      "bbox": [
        54.97,
        623.86,
        291.18,
        717.49
      ],
      "rendered_bbox": [
        219,
