    {
      "block_id": "2605.00224_p15_b22",
      "text": "Figure 4 visualizes ablation results alongside calibration\nanalysis. The left panel shows that TUR-DPO achieves im-\nproved calibration, as measured by ECE and Brier score,\nrelative to baseline methods. The right panel illustrates\nthe contribution of individual components to overall perfor-\nmance, highlighting that the components operate synergisti-\ncally.\n",
